# make scan (trivy config) is advisory — see AGENTS.md "Scanning". Entries
# below are checked findings, not blanket noise suppression; inline
# `# trivy:ignore:<ID>` comments don't take effect for these specific rules
# in the installed trivy version, so they're ignored here instead.

# PodDisruptionBudget for coredns must live in kube-system because that's
# where coredns itself runs — there's no other namespace to put it in.
KSV-0037

# keycloak-operator/operator-hardening-patch.yaml is a kustomize patch, not a resource:
# it has no metadata.namespace because kustomization.yaml's `namespace:` sets it.
KSV-0110

# vpa-admission-controller-patch (vertical-pod-autoscaler/rbac_fix.yaml)
# needs get/list/watch/create/update/patch/delete on its own
# mutatingwebhookconfigurations to self-manage its webhook CA bundle
# (see the vpa-tls-certs ignoreDifferences in autoscaler.yaml) — this
# mirrors upstream kubernetes/autoscaler's own admission-controller RBAC.
KSV-0114
